    "Condition : 1 - 1.\tDue to size, design and positioning, the proposed erection of a side roof extension will result in an imbalanced pair of semi-detached dwellings and consequently will harm the appearance of the dwellinghouse and the character of the street scene. This is considered to be contrary to the provisions of Policies ENV B.1.1 and H.6.4 of the Unitary Development Plan 2003 and Section 5.0 of the Residential Extension Guidelines.",
